      <rules>
        <rule name="Agent of Hokorek – Aura (12”)" id="3681-28a9-d65f-ea4b" hidden="false">
          <description>At the beginning of each turn after the first, if this model’s controlling player has more victory points than their opponent, each friendly unit within 12” of a model with this ability may reroll their failed attrition test rolls.
At the beginning of each turn after the first, if this model’s controlling player has fewer victory points than their opponent, each friendly unit within 12” of a model with this ability may reroll natural attack rolls of 1.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
