                        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">Each time this weapon inflicts a successful hit on a *vehicle*, *construct*, *monster* or *structure* model, the target model gains a drill point. At the end of the phase, if the target model is not slain, make one attack roll with this weapon for each drill point the target has allocated to it. Units cannot make more attacks as a result of drill points than they have models remaining, and damage inflicted by these attacks cannot be allocated to models that do not have drill points allocated to them.</characteristic>
