                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Harpoon Launcher" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="a30e-999a-8eea-7f2f">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">12&quot;</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">1</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+4</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">3</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon can only target units within 12” of the attacking model.
When targeting non-*infantry* units, attacks with this weapon have advantage and always successfully hit on a natural roll of a 10.
Each time a non-*infantry* unit loses a point of health from this weapon, until the beginning of the following shooting phase, it gains a tether point. For each tether point a unit has, it must subtract 1 from its initiative, speed, and charge move distances (to a minimum of 0). If a unit that inflicted any tether points is entirely destroyed, all of the tether points it inflicted are removed. Leviathan units are not affected by tether points.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
                  </profiles>
                </selectionEntry>
                <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Forward-mounted Incinerator" hidden="false" id="e380-d5c0-cf7f-bbc3" defaultAmount="1">
                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Incinerator" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="7168-968d-d438-a6ed">
