      <rules>
        <rule name="Sacred Duty" id="fe21-17cf-e6b5-77fc" hidden="false">
          <description>Groups including this unit cannot include more than one independent unit, and only *leaders* can be included in groups with this unit. This unit always counts as having three or more models for the purpose of being a retinue.
While a *leader* is joined to this unit, it ignores the effects of being shaken, and any abilities which would allow an enemy unit to allocate wounds to a model of their choice have no effect.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
