                  </costs>
                  <rules>
                    <rule name="Demolitions Specialist" id="9bce-c936-6a9e-d41a" hidden="false">
                      <description>During deployment, for each unit in your army that includes a demolitions specialist, select one terrain piece to rig, and secretly note down (or place markers underneath) each rigged terrain piece. When a unit with a demolitions specialist activates in the combat phase, instead of making any other action, it can detonate one visible rigged terrain piece. Each non-*independent* unit (friend and foe) within 3” of a rigged terrain piece loses D5 points of health.
Each terrain piece can only be rigged once per battle, and detonated once per battle. This ability counts as a *trap*.</description>
                    </rule>
                  </rules>
                </selectionEntry>
              </selectionEntries>
            </selectionEntryGroup>
