      <rules>
        <rule name="Covert Operative" id="4ce4-cde5-0b1b-ad61" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit cannot be targeted by ranged attacks or affected by any enemy invocations. The first time this unit makes either a charge move action or shoot action, or if an enemy unit ends a move within 6” of this unit, it loses this ability, until any phase ends where this unit is obscured from, or no longer visible to, all enemy units.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Smoke and Blades" id="afe0-a510-6a19-10b6" hidden="false">
          <description>If this unit makes a successful charge, any attacks with melee weapons that target it have disadvantage.
Successful hits made by this model can be allocated to models in a target unit by the attacking player, rather than by the target unit’s controlling player (even if models in that unit are already injured). Such attacks can also be allocated to *independent* units in a group, even if there are three or models in its retinue.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
