                    <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">Units do not benefit from cover when being targeted by this weapon, unless its bearer has *altitude*. Each time a unit gains an attrition point as part of an attack that includes this weapon, it gains one additional attrition point. This is not cumulative with other instances of this rule.</characteristic>
