            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Forward-mounted Twin Heavy Harpoon Launcher" hidden="false" id="9dca-7ca7-f28b-8fef" sortIndex="3">
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Twin Heavy Harpoon Launcher" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="28cc-c8a0-dd9c-5ed9">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">16&quot;</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">2</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+5</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">3</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon can only target units within 16” of the attacking model, and cannot be used if the bearer has *altitude*.
When targeting non-*infantry* units, attacks with this weapon have advantage and always successfully hit on a natural roll of a 10.
Each time a non-*infantry* unit loses a point of health from this weapon, until the beginning of the following shooting phase, it gains a tether point. For each tether point a unit has, it must subtract 1 from its initiative, speed, and charge move distances (to a minimum of 0). If a unit that inflicted any tether points is entirely destroyed, all of the tether points it inflicted are removed. *Leviathan* units are not affected by tether points.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="10"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
