    <selectionEntry type="model" import="true" name="Cobra Annihilator Craft" hidden="false" id="0d73-88df-9a36-bebb">
      <costs>
        <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="650"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Cobra Annihilator Craft" typeId="profile-unit" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="f4c3-eb7a-a1a8-3612">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="char-speed">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Health" typeId="char-health">40</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Defence" typeId="char-defence">14</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Initiative" typeId="char-initiative">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Morale" typeId="char-morale">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Arcane" typeId="char-arcane">-</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Solar Annihilator" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="87e2-5a30-e56b-309f">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">120&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">12</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">Attacks from this weapon count as *destroyer* attacks. Models slain by this weapon are ontologically annihilated and cannot be resurrected by any means, and any abilities which would add models to a unit as a result of other models being slain do not take effect if those models were slain by this weapon.
When selecting a target for this weapon, the attacking player can choose for it to widen its aperture. If it does so, instead of attacking normally this weapon makes a *blast* attack targeting a visible point on the battlefield, with a radius of 3”, but reduces its damage characteristic to 5.
After firing this weapon, all units within 6” of the target unit (or blast epicentre, if it is firing with a widened aperture) immediately gain an attrition point.
At the end of any activation in which this weapon was fired with a widened aperture, roll a dice. On a natural roll of a 1, this unit immediately loses 2D10 health.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sunderance Missile Launcher" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="b4fa-c2b2-3d23-527b">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">48&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon makes a blast attack targeting a visible point on the battlefield, with a *blast* radius of 5&quot;.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="The Shadow of Hokorek" id="11d2-68a0-b003-ef74" hidden="false">
          <description>When this unit would lose a point of health, roll a dice. For each 8+, that point of health is not lost, and the next time it makes a shoot action, add 1 to the damage of its solar annihilator. In addition, all *infantry* units within 6” of this model subtract 1 from their attrition test rolls.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Explosive End (Singularity Engine)" id="f84e-b14a-f158-4150" hidden="false">
          <description>When this unit is destroyed, before removing the model, it explodes. This explosion is a *blast* attack, with a 6” radius originating from its base, with a strength of +5 and a damage of 3.
If this unit is destroyed by its own Solar Annihilator, its singularity engine instead implodes. All *infantry* models within 2” are vaporised and slain immediately, and the implosion devastates the surrounding area in a *blast* attack with a 12” radius from the model’s base, with a strength of +5 and a damage of D10+10.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
