      <rules>
        <rule name="The Divine Right" id="0ed0-38f3-f510-9989" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time this unit is hit by an attack, before inflicting damage, roll a dice. On a natural 8+, that hit is negated.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Lord of Conquest – Command action" id="56ed-e64f-02ea-485d" hidden="false">
          <description>During the Strategy Phase, one unit with this ability can make this action.
During the Strategy Phase, select one objective marker within 12” of this unit. If, during the subsequent Resolution Phase of that turn, any friendly units (except airborne and shaken units) are within control range of that objective marker, it is claimed by that friendly unit, regardless of any other enemy units in range of it.
Only one friendly unit may make this action each turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
