      <costs>
        <cost name="Auri" typeId="cost-auri" value="85"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Minister of the Faithless – Aura (12”)" id="db29-98b1-2395-5caa" hidden="false">
          <description>Groups including this unit can use its Morale characteristic instead of their own. Additionally, if this unit is destroyed by an enemy unit, all friendly units add 1 to their attack rolls when targeting that enemy unit until the end of the battle.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Guiding Words" id="55b7-4b08-dca4-4cc3" hidden="false">
          <description>In the Movement Phase, after this unit has finished an action (but before any reactions are made), this unit can instil its warriors with guiding words. It can instil them by using one of the following orations:


*Vigilance to the end!*
Select one friendly unit or group within 12”. This unit doubles its initiative characteristic until it makes a reaction in this turn. This is not cumulative with being Ready To React.


*Let fear have no place in your souls!*
Select one friendly infantry unit within 12”. This unit immediately takes an attrition test.


*Fight for your family, for your home, for your freedom!*
Select one friendly unit or group within 12”. This unit can immediately make a Fight action as if it were the Combat Phase, and adds 1 to its attack rolls. It cannot perform any actions or reactions until the next turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
